2. shadow T + (x·y = x∘y):
   => x·y=x              False
   => x·y=y              False
   => x·x=x              False
   => x·y=y·x            True
   => (x·y)·z=x·(y·z)    True
   => x·(x·y)=y          False
   => (x·y)·y=x          False
   => x·(y·z)=x·y        True
